[0.012583, "o", "\u001b[2m  recorded run \u00b7 Tue 20 Oct 2026, 15:17 CEST\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.01261, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.014986, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  The weights are staged once per EU cluster on shared storage, by a CPU job, not on a GPU.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.017432, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  Scale the model to zero and the GPU is released; the weights stay. Scaling back skips the \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m    download.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.017614, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl -n ml-team get modelcache qwen-7b\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.043579, "o", "NAME      REPO                           STAGED   SYNCED   READY   AGE\r\nqwen-7b   Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-AWQ   2/2      True     True    71m\r\n"]
[0.045032, "o", "\r\n"]
