[129.811634, "o", "\u001b[2m  The GPU node itself stays up: the cluster autoscaler can't yet scale a GPU pool up from zero for DRA pods.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[32m\ud83d\udca1 Scale to zero frees the GPU. The weights stay warm.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
